st now? Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_37","text":"What? When have I ever... =.=","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_38","text":"That never happened.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_39","text":"Someone was even saying things like he probably likes feminine girls.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_40","text":"Shut up. =.= That's enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_41","text":"So, are you going to tell us or not?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_42","text":"Oh boy...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_43","text":"Okay, I think I'm ready to hear it now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_44","text":"Uh... wait! T_T Maybe not yet!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_45","text":"... At this rate, the conversation is just going to keep going in circles.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_46","text":"Uh... I think I have to head out on a mission.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_07_47","text":"Sorry, but let's talk again later.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_07_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_abs